s long name without dashes, e.g. message-file.\"\n        },\n        \"type\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"description\": \"string, bool, int, or strings (repeatable; values may contain commas).\"\n        },\n        \"usage\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"description\": \"One-line help text.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"discriminator\": \"type\",\n      \"variants\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"bool\",\n        \"int\",\n        \"strings\"\n      ],\n      \"injects_into\": [\n        \"cmd/{{bin}}/{{command|snake}}_cmd.go\"\n      ],\n      \"anchor\": [\n        \"flags\"\n      ],\n      \"variant_requires\": {\n        \"bool\": [\n          \"flag\",\n          \"usage\"\n        ],\n        \"int\": [\n          \"flag\",\n          \"usage\"\n        ],\n        \"string\": [\n          \"flag\",\n          \"usage\"\n        ],\n        \"strings\": [\n          \"flag\",\n          \"usage\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"action\": \"addImport\",\n      \"package\": \"go\",\n      \"description\": \"Imports one package.\",\n      \"kwargs\": {\n        \"file\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"description\": \"The Go file to write into. It must be one of the authorized files.\"\n        },\n        \"path\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"description\": \"The import path.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"anchor\": [\n        \"imports\"\n      ],\n      \"requires\": [\n        \"path\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"action\": \"addPersistentFlag\",\n      \"package\": \"cobra\",\n      \"description\": \"Add a flag on the root command that every command inherits, with no short form.\",\n      \"kwargs\": {\n        \"bin\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"required\": true\n        },\n        \"flag\": {\n          \"type